<h4>Technical Conception</h4>
ChatGPT was developed in San Francisco by OpenAI and is the upgraded version of GPT-3. GPT-3 was introduced in 2020 and was popular for its natural language system, as it could write, argue and code. It has been released online for free public testing. ChatGPT used the approach of supervised learning as well as reinforcement learning. It works on neural networks and the bot learns skills by analyzing data.</p><p>

<h4>Drawbacks</h4>
Its uneven factual accuracy was identified as a significant drawback. ChatGPT has been programmed to help people get solutions to their queries, not to serve inappropriate requests or requests which need details to accomplish illegal activities. But users have found ways around many of these guardrails, including rephrasing a request for illicit instructions as a hypothetical thought experiment, like asking the chatbot to disable its safety features.</p><p>

Another angle observed is that ChatGPT is a big threat to creativity and originality. Budding poets and software developers who work hard to create original content won’t get enough recognition as chatbots will be able to accomplish those tasks in a matter of minutes.</p><p>


               <p>
The next threat will be to students; although chatbot can help students like a guide or mentor, if students misuse it and get their assignments done with ChatGPT, it can ruin their future too.</p><p>

<h4>How AI, used in ChatGPT, has impacted our Lives</h4>
ChatGPT has been introduced recently and is completely AI-based. In the last couple of years, our lives too have been directly or indirectly impacted by artificial intelligence in many dimensions. Right from fingerprint detection and face recognition to voice commands all of these play such a significant role in our day-to-day lives. Artificial intelligence has broadened the horizon and made things simpler, easier, more reliable and approachable.</p><p>

<h4>AI: The Magic Wand for Business Operations?</h4>
Since no domain has been left untouched by AI, so why should business enterprises stay away from the benefits it offers? Nowadays businesses are getting highly automated and efficient with the introduction of AI. All big companies have introduced their chatbots (though not so efficient) either on websites or on Whatsapp. AI helps in providing swift responses and more insights into customer behavior, resulting in elevated customer satisfaction which in turn scales up businesses.</p><p>

When it comes to optimization of business processes, efficiency enhancement and improved sales performance, we need some effective new-agessolutions which can enhance productivity to multi-folds.</p><p>

